\\\ w & =2(x-1)-2(y+1)-2(z-1) \\\\ w & =2x-2-2y-2-2z+2 \\\\ -2x+2y+2z+w+2 & =0 \\\\ 2x-2y-2z-w-2 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407514 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407516 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407514 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0eadd7d5-26a1-573f-b533-83cfbfb498b9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407514 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342097 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407515 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407518 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407515 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2b51d9b4-6f4d-519a-946f-18af30633fc4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407515 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323964 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407516 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "32cd70ef-6665-5a4e-a0ab-b70e5098e66f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407516 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186265748 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407517 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407514 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407517 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "536015a5-6f9f-597a-ae46-2c87559ba2b3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407517 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342093 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407518 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407517 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407518 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "93f5b13c-94e0-5cb3-a51d-2c9c6f5ed98b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186407518 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186407513 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428523 #edb/ref 1030 1.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186428523 #edb/ref 1032 "Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account foundations: 1 rises / 1 eligible passed source activities = 1.000000; nearest selected fraction = 1. Crossing activity numbers [1]; waits [1]. Separate account estimates: foundations=1 (1/1). Selection: most observations, then lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: False. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does no